[125.948, "o", "coderabbitai[bot] on deploy/utils/quantity.py:32\r\n"]
[125.9501, "o", "** Major** · **Functional Correctness** · **Quick win**\r\n**Use decimal multipliers for `M` and `G`.**\r\n`parse_quantity(\"1M\")` returns `1048576` instead of `1000000`. `memory_bytes(\"1G\")` returns \r\n`1073741824` instead of `1000000000`. These results violate the documented decimal-suffix \r\n"]
[125.9501, "o", "contract and make resource comparisons incorrect.\r\nUse powers of 1000 for both suffixes. Add regression cases for `M` and `G` in \r\n"]
[125.9501, "o", "`deploy/utils/tests/test_quantity.py`.\r\n"]
[129.4333, "m", "The gate notices"]
[129.7333, "o", "\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;240m── \u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;250mThe gate notices\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;240m ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m"]
