[504.941, "o", "\u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;214m ⏩ six minutes of log, sped up \u001b[0m\r\n"]
[505.191, "o", "PR watch at Tue, Nov 17, 18:45 EST: new problems, so the shepherd is starting a run scoped to them.\r\n"]
[505.191, "o", "- #11 (head 418a77b): no merge conflict; CI passed (4 checks)\r\n"]
