[567.5475, "o", "\r\n"]
[567.7975, "o", "**CI diagnosis: cause 2 (stale base), High confidence**\r\n"]
[567.7975, "o", "- The PR only adds 12 lines to `deploy/utils/README.md`. The failing test was \r\n"]
[567.7975, "o", "`test_dump_docs_quotes_yaml11_ambiguous_strings` in `convert_api_version`.\r\n"]
[567.7975, "o", "- The PR's merge base was `07a80bb`, which stopped quoting `y`, `n`, `Y` and `N` in converted \r\n"]
[567.7975, "o", "manifests. Commit `367a899` on the base reverses it exactly.\r\n"]
