[702.9089, "o", "**Review totals:** 1 fixed, 0 declined, 0 refuted, 0 pre-existing. My own review found nothing \r\n"]
[702.9089, "o", "serious beyond CodeRabbit's issue.\r\n"]
[702.9089, "o", "\r\n"]
[702.9089, "o", "**Optional nits for you**\r\n"]
[702.9089, "o", "1. The parser rejects `1.` and `+1`, which Kubernetes accepts. A test rejects `-1`, so leaving out \r\n"]
[702.9089, "o", "signs looks deliberate. Either widen the pattern or say so in the module docstring.\r\n"]
[702.909, "o", "2. The PR description doesn't give the core-logic line count (about 25 lines) under Key Changes. \r\n"]
[702.909, "o", "It also doesn't record that a search found no existing parser, not even in `kubernetes-asyncio`. \r\n"]
[702.909, "o", "The `pr-checklist` skill asks for both.\r\n"]
