[769.1894, "o", "## Needs your attention\r\n"]
[769.1894, "o", "\r\n"]
[769.1894, "o", "1. **#18618: open human feedback, none answered**\r\n"]
[769.1894, "o", "2. **#18619: stacked on an old copy of #18569** (fork point 9c1edac). It lacks e6525eb, the Slime \r\n"]
[769.1894, "o", "NetworkPolicy prerequisite, and #18569's Nov 17 commits. CodeRabbit's security thread \r\n"]
[769.1894, "o", "(`verl/train.mdx:103`) stays open until you restack the branch.\r\n"]
[769.1894, "o", "3. **Threads left unresolved by shadow mode:** CodeRabbit accepted your decline of the \r\n"]
[769.1894, "o", "`TerminalDemo.tsx:278` item on #18619. Resolve it before merge.\r\n"]
[769.1895, "o", "4. **#17372: open 21 days.** Four pings to docs-codeowners have gone unanswered. I didn't ping \r\n"]
[769.1895, "o", "again because the last one was under 3 business days ago. Consider asking a reviewer directly.\r\n"]
[769.1895, "o", "\r\n"]
